== 6. tick starts the hand
  [A] POST /api/table/a84a76fd-7a55-48bd-8fc4-44d45a54ec5f/tick  -> 200 {"ok": true, "changed": false, "version": 1}
  OK   tick ok
  OK   hand started: street preflop
  OK   table public cols carry no state
  OK   publicView: no deck, no seed, seedHash present
  OK   A sees own 2 hole cards
  OK   B does not see A's hole cards
  OK   anon GET state -> 200 (spectator)
  OK   anon sees no hole cards at all, me.seat null, legal null
  OK   anon: no deck, no seed
